        It turns out that MathSoft supplies a function on their help page 
for the "dist" function.  They call it dist2full and it looks like:

function(dis)
{
        N <- attr(dis, "Size")
        full <- matrix(0, n ,n)
        full[lower.tri(full)] <- dis
        full + t(full)
}

